                        <name>TIMB0_CPU_INT_ISET</name>
                        <description>Interrupt set. Allows interrupts to be set by software (useful in diagnostics and safety checks). Writing a 1 to a bit in ISET will set the event and therefore the related RIS bit also gets set. If the interrupt is enabled through the mask, then the corresponding MIS bit is also set.</description>
